## 5. Assets

The academic layout pack under
`skills/ppt-master-sci/assets/template-library/` is original work authored for
this plugin. It contains no upstream template files and no third-party imagery,
fonts or icons: every element is a plain SVG shape or a text placeholder.

The style profiles under
`skills/ppt-master-charts/assets/style-profiles/` are original files:

- `neutral-default.json` is authored for this plugin.
- `blue-gray-business.json` records the colour values of the chart-library
  design reference described in §2. Colour values are unprotectable facts, and
  the file contains nothing else from that source — no text, no geometry, no
  assets. It is marked `reference-sample` and is not the default.

Upstream's own icon, sound and template libraries live inside the submodule and
are covered by upstream's notices.
